              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwirinde ntimukēngēre n’umwe mur’ aba bana bato: ndababgira yuko mw ijuru abamarayika babo bama barāba mu nyonga ha Data wo mw ijuru. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ Umwana w’umuntu yaje gukiza icari cazimiye.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.15.4+LUK.15.5+LUK.15.6+LUK.15.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 15:4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugira ngw iki? Umuntu afise intama ijana, imwe yozimira, ntiyosiga zimwe mirongwicenda n’icenda, akagenda mu misozi kurondera iyazimiye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ iy’ ayibonye, ndababgira ukuri yukw ayinezererwa kuyirutisha zimwe mirongwicenda n’icenda zitāzimiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ko bidakundwa mu nyonga za So wo mw ijuru k’umwe mur’ abo bato apfa rubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
